msgstr ""
"Guarda il video sui circuiti quantistici e le primitive di Olivia Lanes, "
"oppure apri il video in una finestra separata su "
"[YouTube.](https://youtube.com/watch?v=NTplT4WnNbk)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<IBMVideo id=\"134063416\" title=\"In this video, Olivia Lanes explains "
"quantum circuits and primitives. She covers Qiskit Runtime Estimator and "
"Sampler primitives.\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
